<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60850" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠνήγ-ιον</span></b> , τό, later
		form for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνηγέσιον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hunt, chase</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.677e
			</span></i>: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.22.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.29
			</span></i> (v.l. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίαις</span>), etc.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>beast-hunt</i> in the Amphitheatre, = Lat.
				<i>venatio</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3847b8
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Nacolea</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				533.7
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Ancyra</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in pl., <i>game-preserves</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				2.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>prey</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνήγια λεόντων ὄναγροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Si.</u>
					13.19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
